## ✅ 2. **Token Lifecycle Diagram (Client-Side)**

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[User Logs In] --> B{Token Received}
    B --> C[Store Token & lastActivity in localStorage]
    C --> D[Start Heartbeat Timer (every 10 min)]
    D --> E[User Interacts → Update lastActivity]
    E --> F[Heartbeat Success → Continue]
    F --> G[No Activity for 24h?]
    G -->|Yes| H[Clear Session & Redirect to Login]
    G -->|No| I[Continue Active Session]
    J[User Clicks Logout] --> K[Call /api/logout]
    K --> L[Server Invalidates Token]
    L --> M[Frontend: Clear localStorage & token]
    M --> N[Redirect to Login Page]
```

> ✅ Visualizes full lifecycle: creation → refresh → invalidation via logout or inactivity.

