| Requirement | Implemented? | How |
|------------|--------------|-----|
| [SESS-EXP-1440MIN] | ✅ | Client-side timer + `localStorage` tracking |
| Immediate logout invalidation | ✅ | `invalidateSession()` clears all data |
| No reliance on server TTL alone | ✅ | Client enforces timeout independently |
| Inactivity detection via heartbeat | ✅ | 10-min ping + timestamp update |
| Token stored securely | ✅ | `localStorage` with validation layer |

